cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PERF-AEO-500 — Black Performers Registry"
version: 1.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
abstract: "500 Black performers (250 actresses, 250 actors) with verified vital data (birth dates on 392 rows, birthplaces on 383, occupations on 410) and a full AEO layer per row. 413 rows are verified against Wikidata/Wikipedia; 87 GAP rows have no Wikidata item and no English Wikipedia article — CultureTechLens is their source of record. Seeded from the founder's Listal lists (S1 217, S2 237, D1-only 33, D2-only 13), which every row credits; this dataset is the named successor to the Listal copy job, closed by the founder's decision on 2026-11-16. 13 rows carry an unresolved MODEL-ONLY SUSPECT flag (§4.4), shipped as-is."
authors:
  - name: "CultureTechLens NFP"
license: CC-BY-4.0
